BUSINESS TRAVEL POLICY

1. Travel Approval

Business travel must be approved by the employee's reporting manager before booking tickets.

2. Transportation

Employees may claim reasonable transportation expenses related to approved business travel.

3. Accommodation

Hotel reimbursement is limited to INR 4000 per night.

4. Meals

Meal reimbursement is limited to INR 800 per day.

5. Expense Submission

Travel expenses must be submitted within 15 days after returning from the business trip.

6. Required Documents

Employees must provide receipts and supporting documents for reimbursement.

7. International Travel

International business travel requires approval from the department head before booking.